<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 76, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>任务定义与评价指标</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FC0F0' }}>01 临床背景与数据</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 604, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, paddingTop: 18, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingBottom: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 690, gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 18, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='info-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>任务：给定一张 224×224 超声图，输出三类的后验概率</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>第一步：读懂混淆矩阵的四个格子</Text>
                <Table
                    style={{ width: '100%', height: 128 }}
                    defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 17, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
                    defaultCellStyle={{
                        border: {
                            left: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                            top: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                        },
                    }}
                    cells={[
                        [
                            { text: '', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FFFFFF' } } },
                            { text: '预测为恶性', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: '预测为非恶性', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        ],
                        [
                            { text: '实际为恶性', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: 'TP 正确检出', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#E8EFF8' } } },
                            { text: 'FN 漏诊', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#B03430' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                        ],
                        [
                            { text: '实际非恶性', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: 'FP 误报', textStyle: { color: '#B03430' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                            { text: 'TN 正确排除', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#F5F7FA' } } },
                        ],
                    ]}
                />
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, gap: 9 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>准确率 Accuracy（整体正确比例）</Text>
                    <Math latex='Acc = \frac{TP+TN}{TP+TN+FP+FN}' width={250} color='#0E3F8C' />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>精确率 Precision（报恶性中有多少真恶性）</Text>
                    <Math latex='P = \frac{TP}{TP+FP}' width={190} color='#0E3F8C' />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>召回率 Recall（真恶性中查出多少）</Text>
                    <Math latex='R = \frac{TP}{TP+FN}' width={190} color='#D9534F' />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>F1（精确率与召回率的调和平均）</Text>
                    <Math latex='F_1 = \frac{2PR}{P+R}' width={190} color='#0E3F8C' />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB' }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#4A5568' }}>macro-F1（三类 F1 的算术平均，本项目选模标准）</Text>
                    <Math latex='\overline{F_1}=\frac{1}{K}\sum_{k=1}^{K}F_{1,k}' width={210} color='#0E3F8C' />
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>漏诊与误诊，代价并不对等</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#E3EDFA', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    把恶性判成良性（<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFC107' }}>FN 漏诊</span>）意味着患者错过最佳治疗窗口；把良性判成恶性（FP 误报）只是多一次穿刺活检。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1.55, fontWeight: 'bold' }}>
                    所以在筛查场景里，恶性类的召回率 R 比总准确率更值得关注。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>为什么用 macro-F1 而不是 Accuracy</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    良性占 56%，若模型把所有图都判为"良性"，Accuracy 也有 56%，但对恶性类的召回率是 0。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    macro-F1 对三类一视同仁，任何一类崩塌都会拉低总分，因此本项目以验证集 macro-F1 作为选模与早停判据。
                </Text>
                <Box style={{ background: '#FFF8E1', borderRadius: 6, padding: 12, marginTop: 'auto' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                        <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>判断：</span>指标不只是评分工具，它把"临床偏好"编码进了训练目标。
                    </Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>BUSI 乳腺超声图像分类 · 乳腺癌智能诊断</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>06 / 38</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
